{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a4/6rjd7x8ovnyy3qg4tn8kwgsoqdxbunn.mp3","text":"消磨时间尚有更好的方法。想不想尝试一下？","alt":"voice_cn/char_172_svrash/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4f/r7tb9cqyly6lkcgp6h96woa74e2scqa.mp3","text":"总是这副心事重重的样子可不行，看见我应当微笑啊......好，就是这样。毕竟我是能帮你解决难题的最好人选，不是吗。","alt":"voice_cn/char_172_svrash/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/3a/2nwgx7rkndgt8y4vyt1r1pvtr939kdf.mp3","text":"那个孩子，是叫阿米娅吗......了不起。若是现在不给她装上枷锁，就要有在未来为她戴上王冠的觉悟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_172_svrash/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/78/4semrocudlm799r8uc9iq13fkeq5c2u.mp3","text":"喀兰贸易公司与罗德岛之联盟的稳固程度，完全取决于你我的想法。看来还是要好好相处呀，我的盟友？","alt":"voice_cn/char_172_svrash/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:3/38/grwbagwahw5gjo5i0keoyi2xoclb9gm.mp3","text":"这份合约，我可以签署。没错，我确实看到其中每条条款都对你和罗德岛有利。","alt":"voice_cn/char_172_svrash/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/3e/cm6hrri3f4msiceu782glbkddidkc73.mp3","text":"我当然明白这合约是对我的戏弄，可是这又如何呢，银灰愿意签署这份不平等的合同——因为你值得银灰这么做。","alt":"voice_cn/char_172_svrash/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a6/rl1n69kc5zvr40ewc0enhbcq61miwas.mp3","text":"恩希亚是否给你添了麻烦？抱歉......保护她、引导她本应是我的责任。仅此一事，今日的我无能为力；也仅此一事，我想请博士你代为完成。","alt":"voice_cn/char_172_svrash/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b0/03crfj8edhniobzuzlibs96a4ggj1d9.mp3","text":"可否引我去罗德岛的甲板？不，就是眺望眺望风景。太久没有展翅，丹增这小家伙，想必也很怀念荒野的气息吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_172_svrash/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/28/hbzvp0rlrafrwgbqzmv8rr6wb9fxmo3.mp3","text":"这样发展下去，你我互相博弈的那一天，迟早会到来。但是我，看上去很高兴？也许吧，毕竟我很期待和你交手，也会珍惜那一天到来前的时光。","alt":"voice_cn/char_172_svrash/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e9/qlznxq0nz6tknavowsfi5lg5takv6wd.mp3","text":"“——天空似乎暗了下来，要下雪了——”","alt":"voice_cn/char_172_svrash/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:3/32/m9lgv7s0i2fasu6cgju8wcb18erppkv.mp3","text":"银灰，你的盟友，前来助力。你不会让我失望的，对吗。","alt":"voice_cn/char_172_svrash/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b5/8uc02ghnrh6lp6c3z34hghbq5fiultp.mp3","text":"路途凶险，经验是必不可少的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_172_svrash/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fd/21mhzno8qhim7782r91xuy5gekjdso9.mp3","text":"虚衔虽不嫌多，但你也知道，我更看重其中有几分是信任。","alt":"voice_cn/char_172_svrash/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3e/rvdk78a2erg29kxw575p5doy79rnqyw.mp3","text":"竟然邀请我参与战斗，你确实很有胆识——作为回敬，就让罗德岛见识下银灰的手段——！","alt":"voice_cn/char_172_svrash/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4c/e51fhorca73tjnl2lnoxi9em4ni6cvx.mp3","text":"客随主便，按你的想法安排就好。","alt":"voice_cn/char_172_svrash/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e7/mexpc1316q4r0cl582v3zml8865zr7s.mp3","text":"要我辅佐你进行指挥？可以，不过也要考虑下代价。","alt":"voice_cn/char_172_svrash/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:8/89/33pncr8l7g1bytianwx0ojp7uvq1qhv.mp3","text":"战场之上，善良是无法拯救他人的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_172_svrash/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f8/7j2kizi2wcjre50tvs5eqnhqvgr29p3.mp3","text":"拿出你们全部的实力——这样至少能让我尽兴。","alt":"voice_cn/char_172_svrash/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9f/gqgwxxb8y0o7ixa83w1r78szb9fwqzy.mp3","text":"有什么想法？","alt":"voice_cn/char_172_svrash/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/97/8fzndhf3gzrypnei8o88rrl914frg8g.mp3","text":"决定了？","alt":"voice_cn/char_172_svrash/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:0/06/677i7q6djx9umx864xkpocf31b6v92u.mp3","text":"我接受。","alt":"voice_cn/char_172_svrash/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c9/2ijzh5yy8d66wbyac7jyp7j4wlsvrar.mp3","text":"可以。","alt":"voice_cn/char_172_svrash/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a6/khz72hb3p0ma4avvjg4bd7couk02zik.mp3","text":"“当他们耀武扬威时，无人知晓......”","alt":"voice_cn/char_172_svrash/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/15/pkx911m47i09gjcb3crbq61rsqvgd1j.mp3","text":"“你为何来到这里——”","alt":"voice_cn/char_172_svrash/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/db/blg4lr6z7z0dnfsh2zjf5hd695un726.mp3","text":"“我的仇敌，我的玩物？”","alt":"voice_cn/char_172_svrash/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/1c/hr2wailc2vasonoubowb03d6508ctz8.mp3","text":"“......当他们哀嚎求饶时，无人应答。”","alt":"voice_cn/char_172_svrash/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:9/99/0jfq67zxtbb51l627ltde4mp1cwvsze.mp3","text":"战斗越艰难，胜利的喜悦越炽热。","alt":"voice_cn/char_172_svrash/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f9/6h7cmkvugf0grsfm8mvh71tbseftmr8.mp3","text":"不错的战斗，即使是我都能感到心潮澎湃。","alt":"voice_cn/char_172_svrash/cn